+
+Registration also requires `"agrees_to_privacy_policy": true` and
+`"privacy_policy_version": 1`, the version of the privacy policy the user was
+shown. Registration without agreement is rejected with `400`, and a version
+that is no longer current with `409` so the user reviews the new text first.
+The server stores when and to which version each user agreed
+(`users.privacy_policy_accepted_at` and `users.privacy_policy_version`;
+accounts created before this was tracked have neither). When the policy text
+changes, bump `CURRENT_PRIVACY_POLICY_VERSION` in `route/auth.py` and
+`PrivacyPolicyActivity.POLICY_VERSION` in the app together.
